#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
ZOTH STUDIO CLI & TUI
=====================
Command Line Interface & Terminal User Interface for Zoth Studio.

Features:
  - Rich ANSI / ASCII banner with cybernetic gold theme
  - Fast subcommand execution: zoth start, zoth stop, zoth status, zoth list, zoth tui, zoth doctor
  - Interactive Curses Terminal Dashboard (TUI) for real-time node & server monitoring
"""

